    <!--
      The diameter of the mark's disc, everywhere the system draws it: the
      Android 12 splash icon, the pre-31 launch window and the recents card.

      112 is the lock screen's disc in `BiometricLock.tsx` and the web splash's
      in `providers.tsx`. One number, because the point of the entrance is that
      nothing about the mark changes size or place between the four pictures a
      cold start shows.
    -->
    <dimen name="contour_mark_disc">112dp</dimen>
